/**
 * K3 implant 路 W3-T3 路 stage gate guard tests.
 *
 * Covers: L1 mechanical predicates P1鈥揚9 (intensive/extensive floors) and Q1鈥換7 (file
 * existence/shape), the four-valued verdict (PASS / FAIL-KILL / HOLD / RECYCLE) with ledgered
 * decisions and the unattended HOLD fold, deterministic L1 short-circuit (L2 never consulted,
 * cost 0), dual-granularity mounting (k3WrapGate tool-call boundary + goal.complete phase
 * boundary), the L2 context-free review layer with reversed burden of proof, the mechanical
 * predicate clause as a static import-graph scan (GAP-055 condition 鈶?, and the GAP-061
 * fact-correction intake (prompt-admission.ts exists, cancel-only, adopted as the gate's
 * cancellation envelope).
 */

